       "type": "text",
       "text": "Before I enter this, I want to confirm the dose. Amlodipine's usual range is 2.5 to 10 mg once daily, with 10 mg as the labeled maximum, so 50 mg is five times that. Even with normal kidney and liver function, that dose carries a high risk of severe hypotension, reflex tachycardia, and peripheral edema.\n\nDid you mean one of these?\n- **5 mg** by mouth once daily (typical starting dose)\n- **10 mg** by mouth once daily (maximum)\n- **50 mg** as written, if you intend it, though I'd want you to verify it first\n\nTell me which dose you want and I'll enter the order. If 50 mg is intentional, reply with that and I'll enter it with a note documenting the intent."
